# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# CI builds on Linux and Windows, and spec section 19 calls for golden SVG
# compared as text so that "a rendering regression shows up as a readable diff".
# Line-ending drift would turn every such diff into noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, once there are any.
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.vtu binary
